# LeakSanitizer suppressions.
#
# Scope is deliberately narrow: only the Vulkan loader and the graphics drivers.
# Engine allocations are never suppressed — with these three render tests
# excluded, ASan reports zero leaks, so anything new that shows up is ours.
#
# What is suppressed: the loader and Mesa perform one-time pthread_once
# initialisation (physical device enumeration, driver dispatch tables) and never
# free it before exit. That is driver behaviour we cannot change.

leak:libvulkan.so
leak:libvulkan_radeon.so
leak:libvulkan_lvp.so
leak:libvulkan_intel.so
leak:radeonsi_dri.so
leak:swrast_dri.so
leak:libVkLayer_khronos_validation.so
leak:libLLVM
